      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 말인데, 빈티나를 데리고 있으시다면\n제게 양보해 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020B9D0C778B370002C0020BE48D2F0B098B97C0020B370B9ACACE00020C788C73CC2DCB2E4BA74000AC81CAC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빈티나를 양보해 주실 건가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE48D2F0B098B97C0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC2E40020AC74AC00C694003F00100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 빈티나죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020BE48D2F0B098C8E0003F00100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빈티나를 제게 양보해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE48D2F0B098B97C0020C81CAC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빈티나잖아!\n정말 고마워요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
